00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:32.721
There are many ways to travel. In Phnom Penh, Malis rides in a tuk-tuk. Tourists like the slow cyclo. Her father rides a motorbike to work. To cross the river, they take a longtail boat. One day, Malis wants to fly in a hot-air balloon! In Battambang, they ride the fun bamboo train.

